  "observations": "Root ordered second reading: whole image and both actual supplied halves viewed before the image-first receipt and text opening; 40 fresh enlarged crops personally inspected, including rotated manuscript20. All agreed and differing words, accents, formulas, indices, deletions, insertions, underlines and margin marks checked. The inserted lemma phrase ends in a distinct period. The D’après sentence occupies the half-line immediately above the indented Soit proof opening and is recorded as an insertion. The lower physical l’ho-/momorphisme division is restored. The proposition terminal period falls outside the underline. The two overprinted t/r positions in structure are now represented with unresolved layer order. The isolated angular mark beside manuscript20 is drawn without a lexical reading. The cancelled top paragraph, GL lettering, nœ thérien spacing, G_af with one f, all summation indices and tensor bases, the three separate Exp cancellations, A. . punctuation, f ltrante, cahque, V_i in the final limit, the index hook and lower tick were verified. The clipped G, ornamental A/O, top spelling and cancelled I remain doubtful. Manuscript20 and archive51 remain distinct. Five doubts remain. No context or mathematical proof check was used."
